      "writtenOn": "2020-11-11T02:56:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Requirement was to add an option to reset RTCRST for any recovery purpose, so instead of adding a new command thought it would be better to be add it as part of reboot command.\nDoing this only as part of RO came as a security requirement from Google.",
      "parentUuid": "12d5e1c5_e3d5def0",
      "revId": "27c8b0b741b286e712391a21bb3d6e7a3453ae63",
